\title{Knop：Group Schemes and Momentum Maps}
\date{2026-10-19}
\taxon{Reference}
\author{author}

\p{Friedrich Knop，Group Schemes and Momentum Maps，Proceedings of the International Congress of Mathematicians 2026，Volume 4: Invited Lectures (Sections 5–8)，SIAM，2026，552–564 页。[正式论文与全文](https://epubs.siam.org/doi/10.1137/25M1811823)，DOI：10.1137/25M1811823，2026 年 7 月 13 日在线发表。}
